  "root_cause": "The module import attempts to import a named export `initCheckboxes` which does not exist; the module likely provides a default export, leaving `initCheckboxes` undefined and preventing the checkboxes enhancement (including exclusive behavior) from running.",
  "repair_strategy": "Modify the import statement to import the default export from the checkboxes module and then invoke it, ensuring the enhancement runs and exclusive checkboxes clear other options in their group.",
